                <invention-title lang="de">LINSENANSTEUERUNGSVORRICHTUNG UND KAMERAMODUL SOWIE OPTISCHE VORRICHTUNG DAMIT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL D'ENTRAÎNEMENT DE LENTILLE, ET MODULE DE CAMÉRA ET DISPOSITIF OPTIQUE LE COMPRENANT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">LENS DRIVING APPARATUS, AND CAMERA MODULE AND OPTICAL DEVICE COMPRISING SAME</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A lens driving apparatus according to an embodiment comprises: a housing, a bobbin disposed inside the housing; a coil disposed around the bobbin; a magnet disposed in the housing; an elastic member coupled to the housing and the bobbin; and a damper disposed on the elastic member and in/on the housing, wherein: the elastic member comprises an inner part coupled to the bobbin, an outer part coupled to the housing, and a connection part for coupling the inner part and the outer part together; the connection part is disposed on first to fourth quadrants of a plane consisting of a first axis and a second axis, and is symmetrical with reference to the first axis; the damper is disposed in the connection part; the plane comprises a first side, a second side, a third side, and a fourth side, the first side and the second side facing each other in a direction parallel to the first axis and the third side and the fourth side facing each other in a direction parallel to the second axis; and the damper is disposed to be closer to the third and fourth sides than the first and second sides.</p>
